  "instructions": [
    "1. Lay out the whole wheat tortilla on a flat surface.",
    "2. Spread 2 tablespoons of hummus down the center of the tortilla.",
    "3. Add 1/4 cup of energizer on top of the hummus.",
    "4. Add 1 cup of lettuce, 1 medium tomato, 1/4 cup of red onion, and 1/4 cup of cucumber on top of the energizer.",
    "5. Season with salt to taste.",
    "6. Fold the bottom edge of the tortilla up over the filling, then fold in the sides and roll the wrap up tightly.",
    "7. Slice in half and serve immediately."
